 3. What is the limitation of Spring Security Basic Auth
    i. To access each REST Api client has to pass the username/password  everytime.
    ii. This is insecure and vulnerable, so to avoid it spring security with JWT token authentication is required
        Once client send username password, then authenticate api will generate a JWT token and send it back to clinet.
        Next time onwards every api call will include JWT token in API Request header.

